# Split from server.lang - dialogue bundle (aetherhaven_dialogue_priestess)
# Full translation keys are aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.<lineKey> (see Hytale I18nModule).
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.body=Serah Thornwell. I administer Gaia's protections and teach others about Her grace. The inn provides shelter, but I cannot perform essential rites wedged into a small room and surrounded by noise. I require a dedicated altar outside: paths, seating, and a statue where people can pray without inhaling kitchen smoke.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c0=You wanted to speak about a home.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c1=You're registered on the bookshelf as requested.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c2=The house is still unfinished.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c3=How is the altar working out for you?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c4=The altar grounds are ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c5=About the blessing...
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c6=You said you needed ground for Gaia.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.c7=I'll leave you to it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.root.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.body=The altar has opened a channel. Bring a flask and I can refill it, widen how much it holds, or strengthen its healing. When you need full mending, ask me here. That stays separate from the draught.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_quest=About the undead hunt for the draught.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_progress=I am still clearing the restless dead.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_turnin=The hunt is finished. I am ready for the draught.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_refill=Please bless the flask.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_shard=Offer a shard and tithe {gold} gold coins to increase the vessel's capacity.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_catalyst=Offer a verdant catalyst and tithe {gold} gold coins to deepen your draught.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_hub.c_back=Another topic.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_offer.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_offer.body=Twelve restless spirits still threaten the roads beyond the altar. Reduce their numbers to secure safe passage for travelers, then return so I can teach you to prepare Gaia's Draught.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_offer.c0=I'll do it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_offer.c1=Not right now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_active.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_active.body=The count is not sufficient yet. Continue your patrol and help keep the roads clean.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_active.c0=I'll keep at it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_turnin.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_turnin.body=That is enough. Gaia smiles on this work. I will give you a filled flask and teach you the recipe at your planning desk.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_turnin.c0=Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_turnin.c1=Give me a moment.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_complete.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_complete.body=It is done. The recipe waits at your planning desk. Carry the flask with care.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_quest_complete.c0=Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_refill_done.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_refill_done.body=It is full again. Drink when you must.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_refill_done.c0=Back to the list.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_shard_done.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_shard_done.body=Good. The vessel expands. Treat the extra capacity as an expression of trust.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_shard_done.c0=Back to the list.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_catalyst_done.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_catalyst_done.body=Your draught is enriched now. Utilize that power for survival, not display.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_catalyst_done.c0=Back to the list.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_heal_done.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_heal_done.body=There. Stabilize your breathing. By the grace of Gaia may you be healed.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.draught_heal_done.c0=Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.rep_reward_50.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_abandoned.body=No hard feelings. Though the town would benefit most from my services if I have an altar. Come find me when you are ready to discuss it again.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_abandoned.c0=All right.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_abandoned.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_altar_accepted.body=I will remain at the inn until the altar is constructed. Then find me at the statue, and we will bless the site.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_altar_accepted.c0=I'll see you there.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_altar_accepted.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_building.body=When the altar stands, I will approach the statue. Come find me there, and we will confirm completion.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_building.c0=I need to drop the quest.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_building.c1=I'm still working on it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_building.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_done.body=The altar is finished. Thank you. I will maintain the grounds and conduct rites here as the town expands.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_done.c0=Good luck with it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_done.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_accepted.body=When the house is built, place my name on the bookshelf inside, then come find me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_accepted.c0=You will.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_accepted.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_finish.body=Blessings upon you. A humble place for comfortable rest is exactly what I needed.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_finish.c0=You deserve it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_finish.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_offer.body=The altar serves everyone. I still require a small house of my own, same as anyone else, so I am not living out of the inn hall indefinitely. Build it using the standard token, then register me on the bookshelf when it's ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_offer.c0=I'll stake a house plot for you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_offer.c1=Another time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_offer.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_remind.body=Construction takes time. When the house is done, register me on the bookshelf, then come talk with me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_remind.c0=I'll come back.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_house_remind.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_quest_altar.body=Stake a Gaia altar plot: paths, stools, and the statue where I can stand and folk can sit. I will provide the placement requirements. Use your staff and pay the sign cost. When built, meet me at the statue so we can consecrate it properly.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_quest_altar.c0=We'll get it built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_quest_altar.c1=Not right now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.serah_quest_altar.speaker=Serah Thornwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.love=Gaia smiles upon such generous donations. Go with Her grace.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.like=A sincere contribution. I will utilize it effectively.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.neutral=I will store it with the other supplies for the day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.dislike=This offers no value to Her cause. Thank you, but no.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.fallback=If you need the altar, housing updates, or assistance with Gaia's work, let me know.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.0=Gentle winds and warm braziers make for a good day in Gaia's grace.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.1=If you seek quiet reflection, you have chosen a suitable hour for it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.2=I am a humble servant of Gaia and I speak her will to those who will listen.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.3=Stay a while and listen. Gaia speaks to those who keep an open mind and welcoming heart.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.4=The air is calm enough that the candles burn steady. A perfect time for reflection on one's purpose.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.5=The undead are forbidden in Gaia's realm. You would be in her grace if you destroyed them without hesitation.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.6=I swept the walkway before you arrived. Order and cleanliness are key.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.7=You may not believe in Gaia, but she believes in you, and she knows your name.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.8=If you carry worry in your heart, sit with me and we can address it together.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.greeting.9=I can heal wounds, but I do not have a salve for a corrupted heart.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.love.0=Hearty food after a vigil sustains the body better than prayers alone.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.love.1=Clean bandages and reliable potions are always needed here.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.love.2=If you bring light motes or health vials, Gaia's altar will shine even brighter.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.love.3=Jewelry with purpose can serve as an offering if the intent is pure.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.love.4=I accept any gift intended sincerely for the altar's function.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=Some items carry contamination better left undisturbed. Do not bring them here.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=Grit and grime have no role in this site of purity and cleanliness.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.dislike.2=Unsanitized bone artifacts do not belong here.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.dislike.3=Decay and refuse near this sanctified place upset and disturb the blessings of Gaia.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.hint.dislike.4=If it belongs in a gutter, keep it there or throw it out.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.c_draught=About the undead hunt for Gaia's Draught.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.c_services=Gaia's Draught, refills, and the altar's channel.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.c_heal=Heal me. I will pay the tithe.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.opener.accepted=Good. Clear the restless dead beyond the shrine until the count is met, then return for Gaia's Draught and the recipe.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.main_hub.opener.declined=A shame, but I understand. The restless dead will linger on, but the offer will remain if you change your mind.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.birthday.greeting=Thank you for sharing this birthday with me. Gaia smiles on kind hearts.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_priestess.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
